3. Symbols Nerd Font Mono
==============================================================================

File: dist/terminal/ghostty/fonts/SymbolsNerdFontMono-Regular.woff2, the
symbols-only font of Nerd Fonts 3.4.0 (https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts,
patched-fonts/NerdFontsSymbolsOnly), converted to WOFF2 with its glyphs
unchanged. Its font name is "Symbols Nerd Font Mono", which uses no Reserved
Font Name of the sets below.

Nerd Fonts itself is MIT (dist/terminal/ghostty/fonts/LICENSE):

Copyright (c) 2014 Ryan L McIntyre

The font holds glyphs from the glyph sets below, which keep their own
licences. Nerd Fonts' patcher rescaled and repositioned every set's glyphs
to fit a monospaced cell, and corrected individual glyphs in some sets
(Codicons and Material Design Icons among them); those are the changes to
the original works.

